# Theme implementation

Read **`docs/01-primitives.md`** and **`docs/02-tokens.md`** before editing.

## Structure in `global.css`

- `@theme { }` — fonts, `--text-*`, `--radius-*`, `--spacing-*`, `--tracking-*`
- `@layer theme { :root { @variant light { … } @variant dark { … } } }` — `--color-*`

Uniwind generates utilities from namespaces: `--color-accent` → `bg-accent`, `text-accent`, etc.

## Rules when adding/changing tokens

1. Document in `docs/02-tokens.md` first (name, light, dark, utility class).
2. Add variable in **both** `@variant light` and `@variant dark`.
3. Prefer existing namespaces: `--color-`, `--font-`, `--text-`, `--radius-`, `--spacing-`.
4. If JS needs the hex (Switch, icons), update `src/themeColors.ts` to match.

## Current semantic colors (keep aligned)

| Token | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| accent | `#2563eb` | `#60a5fa` |
| success | `#078a4b` | `#55c986` |
| canvas / surface / field | white / `#f6f6f6` / `#f6f6f6` *(light field: tune independently)* | black / `#0d0d0d` / `#0a0a0a` *(field = surface − 1 step)* |
| foreground / muted | `#101010` / `#5e5e5e` | white / `#ababab` |

